{"id":276740346,"title":"257 程序操作MySQL-查询结果转对象-mysql2驱动","summary":"数据库-在程序中如何操作MySQL的逻辑（理解)","content":"<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783474378287-a914ddec-6900-4dcd-a7ff-f8046326b732.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783474586366-faa14845-6aab-4e42-9a1d-807aba876e8e.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>数据库-在程序中如何操作MySQL的逻辑（<font style=\"color:#DF2A3F;\">理解</font>)</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783474498986-318cd8a0-b98f-43ab-9491-fb796ddbb6d3.png\" alt=\"在Node程序中执行SQL语句\"></p>\n<p>数据库-数据库查询结果转化为对象类型（<font style=\"color:#DF2A3F;\">掌握</font>)</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783475077001-09e8dd3e-4c62-47d8-b68e-ee7747ceeac1.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783475207056-8ffb7ab5-841f-46ce-bac6-cc1e2dddd075.png\" alt=\"查询到的结构转化成对象类型\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783475773456-e67fd87e-2858-431b-ab67-8b6c7cc0d844.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783475858720-ba009129-3f1d-4ce7-85d8-eeeff2ac8c39.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783475871503-165cfb6d-178c-40ce-b3ba-c01576f09152.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>数据库-数据库查询结果转化为数组对象（<font style=\"color:#DF2A3F;\">掌握</font>)</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783475955266-ba2af05a-91f9-4b74-a5b9-3fa78f5abe69.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>把没有选课的学生过滤了。<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783475988566-7a76f05c-2039-4345-97a5-a0b704f6f8da.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>我们要进行<font style=\"color:#DF2A3F;\">分组</font>去处理下图这个问题。</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783476096380-39c41b0a-23e7-42e9-98e4-82914e6ce925.png\" alt=\"查询到的结果转化为数组类型\"></p>\n<p>我们最终会变为这种形式<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783476296410-cf19cf5d-6456-4a75-8759-361ba4ddc50d.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783476313507-a3727876-5c0c-4c32-a76f-12dc970d6c0d.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783476742509-4c51816e-6225-4ce8-ad60-4e26507097bb.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>mysql2驱动-操作数据库的基本使用过程（<font style=\"color:#DF2A3F;\">理解</font>)</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783476863593-91b0b01d-cc91-4ddc-bd14-54ade0d64c13.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783476891277-113fd7dc-4d1f-4ed6-856e-09e8790d197c.png\" alt=\"\">安装这个库<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783476915678-767a69a5-ac80-4221-82c3-0c89bcc79007.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>我们自己电脑数据库的：</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783477044029-bfac59cd-8634-4dd1-9848-593eeb88d9ba.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>这些语句都是可以执行的</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783477244420-bb19e22d-205f-403d-b8fb-33fa6760b165.png\" alt=\"MySQL2驱动使用过程\"></p>\n<p>启动<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783477317217-13096310-95a5-49c5-889a-99c137612379.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783477464069-bc9c48fe-771d-4571-921f-d9c8dcddb646.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>mysql2驱动-预处理语句的优点和使用方法（<font style=\"color:#DF2A3F;\">理解</font>)</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783477968679-2d121ccf-9542-449c-aa3c-202a89da370e.png\" alt=\"mysql执行过程处理语句的性能优化\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783478408611-0d9737e9-d273-4d24-a3e6-c90d2542c7e1.png\" alt=\"mysql执行预处理语句-防止SQL注入\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783478597883-64f16a2a-ab01-4e29-880c-a95a3b70f301.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783478620337-55b8ca93-e45b-45d1-bce4-d6d23f590df0.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>mysql2驱动-连接池的优化和使用方法（<font style=\"color:#DF2A3F;\">理解</font>)</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783478809376-05c3db52-db93-4742-b13f-debdd63b9506.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783479010547-aac50f18-2050-43c2-92f1-490785724754.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783479089987-bb7d5fda-13fa-45af-a904-c9cfdb7ca8af.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>mysql2驱动-回调结果Promise的用法（<font style=\"color:#DF2A3F;\">理解</font>)</p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783479823110-2206ee0a-b5e4-4897-b727-b0bd803fae52.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>res本身是一个数组<img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783479922694-37abf11b-e65e-46f6-a14b-a91f574ec08e.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://cdn.nlark.com/yuque/0/2026/png/69792028/1783480124123-82b56567-ad64-491c-a9df-337e42a1a3e8.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>项目实战-coderhub的项目介绍（<font style=\"color:#DF2A3F;\">理解